=\"no\">02</span><div class=\"body\"><p class=\"title\">《浮生六记》<span class=\"author\">沈复</span></p><p class=\"why\">寻常日子里的小欢喜，一篇几分钟就能读完。</p></div></li>\n<li><span class=\"no\">03</span><div class=\"body\"><p class=\"title\">《小王子》<span class=\"author\">圣埃克苏佩里</span></p><p class=\"why\">“真正重要的东西，用眼睛是看不见的。”</p></div></li>\n<li><span class=\"no\">04</span><div class=\"body\"><p class=\"title\">《瓦尔登湖》<span class=\"author\">梭罗</span></p><p class=\"why\">湖边的四季很慢，读着读着心就静下来。</p></div></li>\n<li><span class=\"no\">05</span><div class=\"body\"><p class=\"title\">《夜晚的潜水艇》<span class=\"author\">陈春成</span></p><p class=\"why\">短篇轻盈又奇妙，适合带着想象入梦。</p></div></li>\n</ol>\n<p class=\"foot\">今晚先读哪一本？</p>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>\n"}}}
